  m_text: "S\u0131v\u0131lar\u0131 \u015Fu s\u0131rayla, kab\u0131n kenar\u0131ndan
    yava\u015F\xE7a d\xF6k\xFCn:\nTaban: \xD6nce bal\u0131 kab\u0131n en alt\u0131na
    koyun.\nOrta Katmanlar: \xDCzerine s\u0131ras\u0131yla suyu ve s\u0131v\u0131
    ya\u011F\u0131 ekleyin.\nZirve: En \xFCste alkol\xFC damlatarak katman\u0131
    tamamlay\u0131n."
